---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
const lang = 'en';
const code = `<iframe src="${SITE_URL}/embed/pay-calculator/" title="New Zealand PAYE and take-home pay calculator" width="100%" height="900" style="border:0;max-width:1100px" loading="lazy"></iframe>`;
---
<PageLayout title="Embed the New Zealand Take-Home Pay Calculator on Your Site" description="Add the New Zealand PAYE, KiwiSaver and ACC take-home pay calculator to your website for free with one iframe: no sign-up, no tracking, rates kept up to date by us." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: route('home', lang) }, { name: 'Widget', path: route('widget', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Widget' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Embed the calculator on your site</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-navy-600">One line of code, no sign-up, no fee. Recruiters, accountants, relocation services, unions and newsrooms can offer the full PAYE and KiwiSaver calculator to their readers in a minute.</p></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <p>Paste this code where the calculator should appear. The height does not adjust automatically: 900 pixels suit a desktop layout; allow 1,250 pixels in a narrow column.</p>
    <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-navy-900 p-4 text-sm text-white"><code>{code}</code></pre>
    <p>Please keep the nzsalary.com credit under the calculator and leave the widget as it is. Nothing is promised about availability or results. New rates from Inland Revenue, ACC or a Budget are applied on our side, so a page embedding the calculator is brought up to date without you lifting a finger.</p>
    <p>Visitors’ pay details are never sent to us: PAYE and KiwiSaver are computed inside their own browser, and the embedded page contains no analytics or advertising code. For a custom size or anything else, use the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-navy-200">
    <iframe src="/embed/pay-calculator/" title="New Zealand PAYE and take-home pay calculator" width="100%" height="900" style="border:0" loading="lazy"></iframe>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
